  "_provenance": "Captured 2026-09-08 from the LIVE platform DB (project brsgrqvjdzwihsvnfqkf) — `select * from agx_get_list_full()` plus the two Mandate Holders this extension binds. Not hand-written: a hand-built row would prove the picker parses a shape the server does not send, which is exactly how the extension's own agent list drifted before. Re-capture, never edit. Extended 2026-09-09 with the two ARCHIVED rows the same live RPC returns (`agx_get_list_full()` does not filter `is_archived` — one system builtin, one owner-scoped) plus one ACTIVE owner-scoped row, so the \"Mine\" tab can show an archived row appearing BESIDE a live one, so THE ARCHIVED-ITEMS LAW can be proven against rows the server really sends. The RPC's newer `orchestra` column is omitted on these two to keep every fixture row one shape; nothing under test reads it.",
